<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 13.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 13.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.53    5.15</p>
<p> 2   Hills Inds	     13.54    1.92</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	12.01    1.02</p>
<p> 4   Mt Leyshon Gold	11.06    2.26</p>
<p> 5   Aust Tour		 9.38    0.80</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.32    1.09</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   9.27    1.76</p>
<p> 8   Villa World	     9.17    1.20</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   9.05    0.95</p>
