<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	8.67    0.90</p>
<p>12   Spotless Svc	    8.46    1.30</p>
<p>13   Colonial Mutual	 8.27    1.25</p>
<p>14   Colonial Coml	   8.20    2.25</p>
